  ItemNumber: SCP-005
  SpecialContainmentProcedures: SCP-005 poses no immediate risk in any direct sense.
    Even so, its unique functions require special measures be taken to restrict access
    and manipulation of the object. Approval of at least one (1) Level 4 personnel
    is required for the removal of the object from its containment area.
  Description: In appearance, SCP-005 resembles an ornate key, displaying the characteristics
    of a typical mass produced key used in the 1920s. The key was discovered when
    a civilian used it to infiltrate a high security facility. SCP-005 seems to have
    the unique ability to open any and all forms of lock (See Appendix A), be they
    mechanical or digital, with relative ease. The origin of this ability has yet
    to be determined.
  clearanceLevel: 0
  containmentClass: 0
  disruptionClass: 0
  riskClass: 0
